point zero.

112
00:04:30,792 --> 00:04:33,167
Geometry, colors, and motion have changed.

113
00:04:33,458 --> 00:04:36,125
They are awaiting library selection; keep
the source credit

114
00:04:36,125 --> 00:04:37,083
